# Pre-flight Template

Purpose:
  Pre-flight command execution document.
  Run before invoking an API to verify environment readiness.

Owns: templates\specdd\preflight-template.sdd

## Checks

Preflight_Checks:
  - server_alive: Health endpoint returns 200
  - db_migration_applied: Latest migration version matches expected
  - credentials_loaded: Required env vars present
  - dependency_running: Required services (DB, cache, queue) are up

## Format

Preflight_Doc:
  API: {API_NAME}
  Before running:
    1. Check server alive: curl {health_url}
    2. Check DB migration: {migration_check_command}
    3. Check credentials: {credential_check_command}
    4. Check dependencies: {dependency_check_command}

  If any check fails:
    → STOP
    → Do not proceed with API call
    → Notify operator

State: +
